{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Why do you look.</b> Why do you look at one another, each expecting that his fellow will go and search, as the Sages said (Eiruvin 3): a pot shared by partners is neither hot nor cold, and likewise (II Kings 14:8) נִתְרָאֶה פָנִים — they show themselves to one another."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 42, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:34:13.120375254Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}